    "body": "## Motivation\n\nJanus-Pro `CLIPVisionTower` image-norm has been broken since the model landed. The torchvision-style transform is shadowed by the VAE GroupNorm factory of the same name, and `forward` calls `torch.nn.functional.normalize` (Lp) instead of per-channel mean/std.\n\nFixes #39708.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Rename the image transform to `ImageNormalize` so it no longer collides with the VAE `Normalize` factory.\n- Apply `(x - mean) / std` per channel in `forward`.\n- Add a small CPU unit test for the math, construction with `pixel_mean`/`pixel_std`, and the factory still returning GroupNorm.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nUnit test covers the normalization math. I do not have a Janus-Pro checkpoint here for an e2e accuracy run.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot affected.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #35064509870](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35064509870)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #35064509741](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35064509741)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #35064509585](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/35064509585)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
